Athena Insights surveyed {{.NComma}} US adults from {{.FieldRange}}, via an opt-in web panel, with quotas balanced to US population benchmarks on sex, age, ethnicity, and political affiliation.

This release includes the results of that survey as a whole-sample topline, then as crosstabs broken out by subgroup, followed by appendices covering the questionnaire, methodology, and unweighted sample composition. 

Results are weighted to US population targets; the full-sample margin of error is ±{{.MOE}} percentage points at {{.Conf}} confidence, accounting for the design effect of weighting. Percentages are out of all respondents, with "Not sure" and "None" answers included.

You can find the underlying data and live visuals for this and other surveys at #link("https://www.americanson.ai/")[americanson.ai].
